body:
Hi {{first_name}},

I will keep this short. If outbound and inbound at {{company}} are mostly manual right now, a 15 minute call is worth it. I will show you the live dashboard, the guardrails, and exactly what it would run for you.

No deck, no pressure. If it is not a fit you will know in the first five minutes.

Here is my calendar: {{booking_link}}

{{sender_name}}

Hi {{first_name}},

I have not heard back, so I will assume the timing is off and stop here.

If a front office that answers, qualifies, and books on its own becomes useful later, the door is open: {{booking_link}}

Thanks for reading, {{first_name}}.

{{sender_name}}

Hi {{first_name}},

Short version: if growth at {{company}} is bottlenecked on headcount, a 15 minute call is worth your time. I will show you the live dashboard, the guardrails, and exactly what the OS would run for your pipeline.

No deck. If it is not a fit you will know fast.

My calendar: {{booking_link}}

{{sender_name}}

Hi {{first_name}},

No reply, so I will assume now is not the time and stop here.

When pipeline-without-a-team moves up your list, the door is open: {{booking_link}}

Thanks for reading, {{first_name}}.

{{sender_name}}
